<title>USA: Port Allegany School District, Pa., adjusted NIC.</title>
<headline>Port Allegany School District, Pa., adjusted NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Port Allegany School District, Pa., said Tuesday it recalculated William R Hough &amp; Co's winning bid for the District's $5 million general obligation bonds, series of 1997.</p>
<p>The District said the net interest cost was 5.54120 percent, reflecting the cost of insurance, not the 5.4672 originally calculated.</p>
